UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So it turned out 4@S was not a very good contract but it was still bid correctly. Every once in a while even with Bergen Hand Evaluation you get too high while more importantly Bergen Hand Evaluation gets you to many making games and slams that other pairs would not get to.|
