mb|P|mb|2C|sb|s|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@C, a cue bid, shows 11 and 3+ cards support--a limit raise. I don't hate the bid but with only 3 spades and the dubious @CQ after the 1@C opener a conservative 2@S would be more desirable. On the other hand, with 5 diamonds the hand is too weak for 2@S so I guess 2@C is probably best.|
